{
  "schema": "ld-s10y-image/figure-spec@2",
  "id": "fig-46",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "fig-46: inspect the original function's increasing/decreasing behavior in its original grid and extent. Source facts are confined to source.inventory and source-inventory.json. Authored additions: Semantic ink/grid/paper roles replace scan texture, preserving mathematical solid/dashed distinctions. Margins, horizontal Arial labels, explicit source-coordinate label placement, and readable fixed-640 composition are authored layout choices. Subpixel point objects only bind assertions to the curve. No visible named points, endpoint circles, coordinate labels, or answer annotations are added. No Cyrillic/Chinese caption, equation beyond the original, explanatory text, or new numeric tick is visible. Piecewise cubic interpolation and tangent estimates are authored regularization, not exact source-pixel givens; domain, exact anchors and extrema are unchanged.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/7a/figures/fig-46.png",
      "sha256": "bd429b597ed80be8fd6eded658a3cf0f5bad1903372dc2c766a2acc2f9ea03bc"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg7-c4-s1-n34",
        "text": "在图46里画出的是气温的曲线图. $x$ 轴上表示时间，$y$ 轴上表示的是相应的温度值. 这个曲线图就是一个函数的图象：对于每一时刻（$x\\in[0,24]$），都有唯一的气温的数值."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg7-c4-s1-n34",
        "text": "图46"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg7-c4-s1-n34",
        "text": "利用这个图象，很容易考察气温随着时间变化的情况."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg7-c4-s1-n34",
        "text": "我们看到，在 $[0,6[$ 区间里，气温下降：曲线上横坐标较大的点，纵坐标反而较小（曲线向下降）. 在 $]6,16[$ 区间里，气温上升：曲线上横坐标较大的点，纵坐标也较大（曲线向上升）. 在 $]16,24]$ 区间里，温度重新下降. 当 $x$ 的值等于 $6$ 时，气温由下降变为上升. 当 $x$ 的值等于 $16$ 时，气温由上升变为下降. 因此，在 $6$ 点和 $16$ 点时，函数变化的性质发生了改变."
      }
    ],
    "inventory": [
